OL,3,GNEWSAInert grenade and cannonball found
OL,4,Ain house
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bomb disposal team was called to a
OL,7,Fcul-de-sac after a suspected grenade
OL,8,Fand cannonball were found in a house.
OL,10,FResidents were temporarily evacuated
OL,11,Ffrom their homes in Little Oaks,
OL,12,FPenryn, Cornwall, after the items were
OL,13,Freported to the Royal Navy team based
OL,14,Fat Devonport in Plymouth.
OL,16,FA navy spokesperson said both items
OL,17,Fwere found to be inert and were
OL,18,Freturned to their owner, and residents
OL,19,Freturned to their homes.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
